 "raw_text": "9/29/26, 9:48 AM\nIf you want to use the service operation in the FI-CA system, you must activate the integration with SAP Credit Management in\nCustomizing for Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable under Integration -> Financial Supply Chain Management -> Credit\nManagement -> Activate Credit Management .\n\nEnhancements\n\nYou can use FI-CA event 4615 to enhance the proxy structure of this operation.\n\nCredit Rating In\n\nDefinition\n\nThe Credit Rating In inbound service interface contains an operation that receives credit ratings.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type               Service Interface\nCategory                  SAP A2A\nDirection         inbound\n\nRespond Credit Rating Query\n\nDefinition\n\nTo receive debtors\u2019 credit ratings.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type                                  Service Operation\n\nRelease State                              released\n\nTechnical Name                          FICARatingReplicateResponse_In\nNamespace                                 http://sap.com/xi/FICA Phe\nApplication Component                  FI-CA\n\nWeb Service Definition (Back End) | FKK_RATINGRPLCTRP\nCategory                                    SAP A2A\nDirection                                     inbound\n\nMode                           asynchronous\n",
 "cleaned_text": "If you want to use the service operation in the FI-CA system, you must activate the integration with SAP Credit Management in Customizing for Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable under Integration -> Financial Supply Chain Management -> Credit Management -> Activate Credit Management .\n\nEnhancements\n\nYou can use FI-CA event 4615 to enhance the proxy structure of this operation.\n\nCredit Rating In\n\nDefinition\n\nThe Credit Rating In inbound service interface contains an operation that receives credit ratings.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type | Service Interface\n\nCategory | SAP A2A\n\nDirection | inbound\n\nRespond Credit Rating Query\n\nDefinition\n\nTo receive debtors\u2019 credit ratings.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type | Service Operation\n\nRelease State | released\n\nTechnical Name | FICARatingReplicateResponse_In\n\nNamespace | http://sap.com/xi/FICA Phe\n\nApplication Component | FI-CA\n\nWeb Service Definition (Back End) | FKK_RATINGRPLCTRP\n\nCategory | SAP A2A\n\nDirection | inbound\n\nMode | asynchronous",
